      <section eId="sec_1.Article-I-Sec-1">
        <num>1.Article-I-Sec-1</num>
        <heading>Political power.</heading>
        <paragraph eId="sec_1.Article-I-Sec-1__para_1" class="indent-1">
          <content>
            <p>All political power is inherent in the people. Government is instituted for their equal benefit, security and protection.</p>
